                                "zh": "这位<w>保龄球手</w>仔细地瞄准了球瓶。"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Every <w>bowler</w> in the league practiced their technique weekly.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "zh": "联盟里的每一位<w>保龄球手</w>每周都会练习他们的技术。"
